  "summary": "`simple-git`, an interface for running git commands in any node.js application, has an issue in versions 3.15.0 through…",
  "details": "`simple-git`, an interface for running git commands in any node.js application, has an issue in versions 3.15.0 through 3.32.2 that allows an attacker to bypass two prior CVE fixes (CVE-2022-25860 and CVE-2022-25912) and achieve full remote code execution on the host machine. Version 3.23.0 contains an updated fix for the vulnerability.",
